Hi Lara,

Switching to the occurrence distribution doesn't fix the issue, as it isn't estimating what you want - space use.

The common solutions would be to segment the data, where you first identify the different patches, or to perform a moving window analysis, though this will inflate during the transitory movement between patches.

Best,
Chirs

